<title>SINGAPORE: Sincere Watch interim profit up 90.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Sincere Watch interim profit up 90.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 0.47    vs     0.24</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)   0.70    vs     0.37</p>
<p>    Turnover		  51.63    vs    59.46</p>
<p>    Interest income	  0.55    vs     0.27</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 0.83    vs     0.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    1.39    vs     0.97</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.55    vs     0.44</p>
<p>NOTE - Sincere Watch Ltd is a retailer of watches and clocks. -- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
